<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/3b41b1f63de46e30/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Sigma.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Dolphin Sigma Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="A high-end model with a gyroscope and triple motors for unparalleled navigation and cleaning coverage."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Dolphin-Sigma"/><meta property="og:title" content="Dolphin Sigma Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="A high-end model with a gyroscope and triple motors for unparalleled navigation and cleaning coverage."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/3b41b1f63de46e30/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Sigma.jpg"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Dolphin Sigma<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/3b41b1f63de46e30/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Sigma.jpg" alt="Dolphin Sigma" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Dolphin Sigma is the flagship of the Dolphin residential line, combining every advanced feature Maytronics has to offer into a single unit. It is the world&#x27;s first robotic pool cleaner to feature a gyroscope for navigation, ensuring precise tracking in even the most irregularly shaped pools. If you want the smartest, most powerful Dolphin available, the Sigma is it.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>The Sigma is built for the <strong>uncompromising pool owner</strong> who wants the best of the best. It is the right choice for:</p><ul><li><strong>Large or irregularly shaped pools</strong> where standard robots get lost.</li><li>Tech lovers who want <strong>Bluetooth app control</strong> and advanced scheduling.</li><li>Owners who need the <strong>anti-tangle swivel</strong> but also want top-load filters.</li><li>Those dealing with heavy algae who need the power of <strong>triple motors</strong>.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Skip the Sigma if:</p><ul><li><strong>You are budget-conscious:</strong> This is one of the most expensive residential robots on the market.</li><li><strong>You prefer simplicity:</strong> If you don't want to mess with an app or Bluetooth connection, the <strong>Premier</strong> offers similar cleaning power with simpler operation.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Gyroscopic Navigation:</strong> Commercial-grade guidance system for precise tracking in complex pools.</li><li><strong>Triple 24V Motors:</strong> Delivers higher suction power and independent drive control.</li><li><strong>Bluetooth App Control:</strong> Schedule and steer the robot from your smartphone.</li><li><strong>Anti-Tangle Swivel:</strong> Ensures the 60-foot cable remains knot-free during operation.</li><li><strong>Massive Top-Load Filters:</strong> Includes both fine and ultra-fine cartridges for customizable filtration.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Navigation Technology:</strong> The Sigma's gyroscope is a game-changer. While other robots rely on algorithms and wheel rotations to guess their position, the Sigma knows exactly where it is and where it's heading. This allows it to clean complex free-form pools with 90-degree turns and islands without missing a beat. It moves in straight lines and corrects its course instantly if pushed by a jet.</p><p><strong>Triple Motor Power:</strong> Unlike standard dual-motor robots, the Sigma boasts three commercial-grade 24V motors. This provides immense flow rate for suction and dedicated power for the dual scrubbing brushes. It creates a vacuum seal against the wall that is virtually unbreakable, allowing it to scrub the tile line aggressively.</p><p><strong>Smart Connectivity:</strong> The Sigma connects to your smartphone via Bluetooth, allowing you to schedule cleanings, manually steer the robot for spot cleaning, and view cleaning history. While not Wi-Fi (so you can't control it from work), the local app control is responsive and feature-rich.</p><p><strong>Best-of-Both-Worlds Design:</strong> It combines the best features of the Premier (swivel cable, multi-media filtration) with the best of the Nautilus (top-load access). You get the massive top-load cartridges that are easy to clean, plus the swivel cable that prevents tangles—a combination rarely found in other models.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Gyroscope ensures 100% pool coverage even in complex shapes</li><li class="list-group-item">Combines top-load filters with a swivel cable (rare feature)</li><li class="list-group-item">Triple motors provide unmatched suction and scrubbing power</li><li class="list-group-item">Bluetooth app allows for manual steering and scheduling</li><li class="list-group-item">3-year bumper-to-bumper warranty</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Very high price point</li><li class="list-group-item">Bluetooth range is limited compared to Wi-Fi</li><li class="list-group-item">Heavier unit due to triple motors</li><li class="list-group-item">Does not include a caddy standard</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Dolphin Sigma is the Tesla of pool cleaners—high-tech, powerful, and expensive. It solves every minor annoyance of other models by combining a swivel cable, top-load filters, and gyroscopic navigation into one package. If your budget allows, it is arguably the best residential pool cleaner money can buy, offering a level of precision and power that cheaper models simply cannot match.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Sigma</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZ1XVZX?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1099</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Dolphin Premier</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1599</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"413\",\"static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js\",\"183\",\"static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nc:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nd:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"sta"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"tic/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nb:T584,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNavigation Technology:\u003c/strong\u003e The Sigma's gyroscope is a game-changer. While other robots rely on algorithms and wheel rotations to guess their position, the Sigma knows exactly where it is and where it's heading. This allows it to clean complex free-form pools with 90-degree turns and islands without missing a beat.