h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Who This Is For\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe Sigma is built for the \u003cstrong\u003euncompromising pool owner\u003c/strong\u003e who wants the best of the best. It is the right choice for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLarge or irregularly shaped pools\u003c/strong\u003e where standard robots get lost.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTech lovers who want \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth app control\u003c/strong\u003e and advanced scheduling.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOwners who need the \u003cstrong\u003eanti-tangle swivel\u003c/strong\u003e but also want top-load filters.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThose dealing with heavy algae who need the power of \u003cstrong\u003etriple motors\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]],[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Who Should Skip It\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eSkip the Sigma if:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou are budget-conscious:\u003c/strong\u003e This is one of the most expensive residential robots on the market.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou prefer simplicity:\u003c/strong\u003e If you don't want to mess with an app or Bluetooth connection, the \u003cstrong\u003ePremier\u003c/strong\u003e offers similar cleaning power with simpler operation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Key Features\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGyroscopic Navigation:\u003c/strong\u003e Commercial-grade guidance system for precise tracking in complex pools.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTriple 24V Motors:\u003c/strong\u003e Delivers higher suction power and independent drive control.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth App Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Schedule and steer the robot from your smartphone.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnti-Tangle Swivel:\u003c/strong\u003e Ensures the 60-foot cable remains knot-free during operation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMassive Top-Load Filters:\u003c/strong\u003e Includes both fine and ultra-fine cartridges for customizable filtration.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$b\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Gyroscope ensures 100% pool coverage even in complex shapes\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Combines top-load filters with a swivel cable (rare feature)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Triple motors provide unmatched suction and scrubbing power\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Bluetooth app allows for manual steering and scheduling\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"3-year bumper-to-bumper warranty\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Very high price point\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Bluetooth range is limited compared to Wi-Fi\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Heavier unit due to triple motors\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Does not include a caddy standard\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Dolphin Sigma is the Tesla of pool cleaners—high-tech, powerful, and expensive. It solves every minor annoyance of other models by combining a swivel cable, top-load filters, and gyroscopic navigation into one package. If your budget allows, it is arguably the best residential pool cleaner money can buy, offering a level of precision and power that cheaper models simply cannot match.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Dolphin Sigma\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZ1XVZX?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-light fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Consider These Alternatives\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Polaris-9650iQ-Sport\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-